  "body_html": "<h1>toValuation_union</h1>\n<h2>Lean type</h2>\n<p><code>lean\nlemma toValuation_union [DecidableEq G] (w : AdditiveValuation N G) (i : N) (S T : Finset G) (h : Disjoint S T) : w.toValuation.val i (S ∪ T) = w.toValuation.val i S + w.toValuation.val i T</code></p>\n<h2>Dependencies</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>toValuation</li>\n</ul>",
